        "kind": "document",
        "locator": "case/Double_Resource_Scheduling_Case_P25_Narrative.md#line=5",
        "text": "A/B/C 的工期、资源需求及三者项目开始后可开工。"
      },
      "case-boundaries": {
        "kind": "document",
        "locator": "case/Double_Resource_Scheduling_Case_P25_Narrative.md#line=19",
        "text": "允许添加零工期 ST/FN：ST→A/B/C，E/H/I→FN，共 11 节点、14 条 FS0 关系；边界节点不是实际施工。"
      },
      "case-resources": {
        "kind": "document",
        "locator": "case/Double_Resource_Scheduling_Case_P25_Narrative.md#line=13",
        "text": "工人和吊机是可重复资源；活动结束后释放已占用资源。"
      },
      "project-policy": {
        "kind": "policy",
        "locator": "ontology/ontology.md#line=21",
        "text": "项目已确认的统一政策：采用已确认数值工期；若活动因转换拆段，允许段间暂停并释放/重新申请可重复资源。"
      },
